# Offline option for the platform stack (nur-tricenter-local): ms5 on the platform Postgres instead
# of Neon. Copy to `.env` (gitignored). The `ms5_logistics` database and the dev-only user are
# created by nur-tricenter-local's start-stack; the schema is applied by the nurtricenter-migrate job.
ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=Host=nur-tricenter-postgres;Port=5432;Database=ms5_logistics;Username=dev-only;Password=dev-only-password
